sbt linguist-vendored
website/* linguist-vendored
docs/* linguist-vendored

# Contributor-facing process docs we author and review here, so they should show up
# in diffs like any other reviewed file rather than being collapsed as vendored.
docs/task-tracking.md -linguist-vendored

# Treat huge morphir json blobs as binary files. Don't show diff
morphir-ir.json binary

# Beads audit log: append-only, one JSON event per line, and line order carries no
# meaning (each entry has its own id and created_at). Two branches appending
# different lines conflict textually while being semantically compatible, so take
# both sides rather than making a human resolve it. See docs/task-tracking.md.
.beads/interactions.jsonl merge=union
